[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD011
TITLE: Bounds refusal
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall reject a configuration with 5 runways, reject a configuration that allows more than 8 aircraft, and reject the ninth aircraft at an airport already holding 8. Acceptance is those three refusals and no issued clearance in the first two cases.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The envelope is an operational limit, so the test sits just outside it.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment.
